# Detailed Architecture Diagram

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph A[Source Control + Triggers]
        SCM[Git provider\npush / PR / merge to main]
        MANUAL[Manual re-run / resume / override]
        SCHED[Nightly scheduled checks]
    end

    subgraph B[.NET Entry Layer]
        API[Webhook Intake API\nASP.NET Core / Minimal API\nstarts workflows]
        OPS[Ops API / Admin UI\nresume, query, signal, update]
    end

    subgraph C[Temporal Cloud]
        NS[Namespace\ncicd-prodctl]
        TQ1[pipeline-orchestrator]
        TQ2[build-test]
        TQ3[gitversion]
        TQ4[publish]
        TQ5[deploy]
        WF1[PipelineIngressWorkflow]
        WF2[BuildValidationWorkflow]
        WF3[VersionAndPublishWorkflow]
        WF4[DeploymentWorkflow]
    end

    subgraph D[.NET Worker Fleet]
        W1[Orchestrator Worker\nexecutes Workflow code]
        W2[Build/Test Activity Worker]
        W3[GitVersion Activity Worker]
        W4[Publish Activity Worker]
        W5[Deploy Activity Worker]
    end

    subgraph E[External Execution Systems]
        RUNNER[Runner Pool\nbuild / unit / integration / scans]
        GV[GitVersion CLI / lib\nsame checked-out repo]
        REG[Container Registry]
        DEV[DEV environment]
        QA[QA environment]
        NOTIFY[Notifications / ticketing / chat]
    end

    subgraph F[Observability + Control]
        UI[Temporal Web UI]
        CLI[Temporal CLI]
        METRICS[Metrics / logs / traces]
        SEARCH[Search Attributes / Visibility]
    end

    SCM --> API
    MANUAL --> OPS
    SCHED --> API
    API --> WF1
    OPS --> WF1
    OPS --> WF4

    WF1 --> TQ1
    WF2 --> TQ1
    WF3 --> TQ1
    WF4 --> TQ1

    TQ1 --> W1
    WF2 --> TQ2
    TQ2 --> W2
    WF3 --> TQ3
    TQ3 --> W3
    WF3 --> TQ4
    TQ4 --> W4
    WF4 --> TQ5
    TQ5 --> W5

    W2 --> RUNNER
    W3 --> GV
    W4 --> REG
    W5 --> DEV
    W5 --> QA
    W2 --> NOTIFY
    W4 --> NOTIFY
    W5 --> NOTIFY

    UI --> NS
    CLI --> NS
    W1 --> METRICS
    W2 --> METRICS
    W3 --> METRICS
    W4 --> METRICS
    W5 --> METRICS
    WF1 --> SEARCH
    WF2 --> SEARCH
    WF3 --> SEARCH
    WF4 --> SEARCH
```
